{
  "id": "grammar-4",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 4,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "詞性判斷：名詞、動詞、形容詞、副詞",
  "titleEn": "Parts of Speech",
  "summary": "多益 Part 5 最常考的題型：看空格位置選對詞性。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "多益 Part 5 有很多題，四個選項是同一個字的不同樣子，例如 decide、decision、decisive、decisively。",
        "這種題目不用懂整句意思，只要看「空格在句子的哪個位置」，就知道要選哪一種詞性。",
        "名詞是「人、事、物」，動詞是「動作」，形容詞「形容名詞」，副詞「形容動詞或形容詞」。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "先看空格前後的字，再用字尾判斷選項的詞性："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "空格位置",
          "要填",
          "常見字尾",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "the／a／my／形容詞 後面",
            "名詞",
            "-tion、-ment、-ness、-er、-ity",
            "the decision、a payment"
          ],
          [
            "主詞後面、will／can 後面",
            "動詞",
            "-ize、-ify、-en",
            "will improve、can decide"
          ],
          [
            "名詞前面、be 動詞後面",
            "形容詞",
            "-ful、-ive、-able、-al、-ous",
            "a careful plan、is available"
          ],
          [
            "動詞前後、形容詞前面",
            "副詞",
            "-ly",
            "carefully check、very quickly"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "口訣：冠詞後面放名詞，名詞前面放形容詞，動詞旁邊放副詞。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "We made a quick decision.",
          "zh": "我們很快做了決定。",
          "highlight": "decision",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-4/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "Please check the numbers carefully.",
          "zh": "請仔細檢查數字。",
          "highlight": "carefully",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-4/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The new product is very successful.",
          "zh": "新產品非常成功。",
          "highlight": "successful",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-4/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The company will expand next year.",
          "zh": "公司明年將會擴張。",
          "highlight": "expand",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-4/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "We",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "made",
              "label": "動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "a quick",
              "label": "冠詞＋形容詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "decision.",
              "label": "名詞"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "a quick 後面要接名詞，所以是 decision"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Please",
              "label": "請"
            },
            {
              "text": "check",
              "label": "動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "the numbers",
              "label": "受詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "carefully.",
              "label": "副詞"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "形容動作 check 怎麼做，用副詞 carefully"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "She is a care driver.",
          "right": "She is a careful driver.",
          "why": "driver 是名詞，前面要用形容詞 careful。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "He spoke very quick.",
          "right": "He spoke very quickly.",
          "why": "形容動作 spoke，要用副詞 quickly。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "We need to make a decide.",
          "right": "We need to make a decision.",
          "why": "a 後面要接名詞 decision。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "practice",
      "title": "互動練習",
      "intro": "選出正確答案。答錯會再出一題類似的。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-0a",
          "group": "grammar-4-0",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "respond",
            "response",
            "responsive",
            "responsively"
          ],
          "answer": "response",
          "explanation": "your quick 後面要接名詞，response（回覆）是名詞。",
          "sentence": "Thank you for your quick ___.",
          "zh": "謝謝你的快速回覆。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "respond": "respond（動詞）是「回應；回覆」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-1a",
          "group": "grammar-4-1",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "available",
            "availability",
            "avail",
            "availably"
          ],
          "answer": "available",
          "explanation": "be 動詞 is 後面放形容詞，available（可用的）。",
          "sentence": "The meeting room is ___ on Friday.",
          "zh": "會議室星期五有空。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "availability": "availability（名詞）是「可得性；有空（的時間）」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-2a",
          "group": "grammar-4-2",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "care",
            "careful",
            "carefully",
            "carefulness"
          ],
          "answer": "carefully",
          "explanation": "形容動作 read 怎麼做，用副詞 carefully。",
          "sentence": "Please read the instructions ___.",
          "zh": "請仔細閱讀說明。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "care": "care（名詞／動詞）是「照顧；在乎」",
            "careful": "careful（形容詞）是「小心的」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-3a",
          "group": "grammar-4-3",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "improve",
            "improvement",
            "improved",
            "improving"
          ],
          "answer": "improve",
          "explanation": "to 後面接動詞原形 improve。",
          "sentence": "Our goal is to ___ customer service.",
          "zh": "我們的目標是改善顧客服務。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "improvement": "improvement（名詞）是「改善；進步」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-4a",
          "group": "grammar-4-4",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "impress",
            "impression",
            "impressive",
            "impressively"
          ],
          "answer": "impressive",
          "explanation": "presentation 是名詞，前面用形容詞 impressive。",
          "sentence": "She gave an ___ presentation.",
          "zh": "她做了一場令人印象深刻的簡報。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "impress": "impress（動詞）是「使印象深刻」",
            "impression": "impression（名詞）是「印象」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-5a",
          "group": "grammar-4-5",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "construct",
            "construction",
            "constructive",
            "constructed"
          ],
          "answer": "construction",
          "explanation": "The ___ of：冠詞 the 後面接名詞 construction。",
          "sentence": "The ___ of the new office took six months.",
          "zh": "新辦公室的建造花了六個月。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "construct": "construct（動詞）是「建造」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-6a",
          "group": "grammar-4-6",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "significant",
            "significance",
            "significantly",
            "signify"
          ],
          "answer": "significantly",
          "explanation": "形容動詞 increased 增加的程度，用副詞 significantly。",
          "sentence": "Sales increased ___ last year.",
          "zh": "去年銷售大幅增加。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "significant": "significant（形容詞）是「重大的；顯著的」",
            "significance": "significance（名詞）是「重要性；意義」",
            "signify": "signify（動詞）是「表示；意味著」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-7a",
          "group": "grammar-4-7",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "complete",
            "completion",
            "completely",
            "completeness"
          ],
          "answer": "complete",
          "explanation": "must 後面接動詞原形 complete。",
          "sentence": "All employees must ___ the form by Friday.",
          "zh": "所有員工都必須在星期五前完成表格。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "completion": "completion（名詞）是「完成」",
            "completely": "completely（副詞）是「完全地」"
          }
        }
      ],
      "similar": [
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-0b",
          "group": "grammar-4-0",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "reply",
            "replied",
            "replying",
            "replies"
          ],
          "answer": "reply",
          "explanation": "your 後面接名詞 reply。",
          "sentence": "We are waiting for your ___.",
          "zh": "我們在等你的回覆。"
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-1b",
          "group": "grammar-4-1",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "available",
            "availability",
            "availably",
            "avail"
          ],
          "answer": "available",
          "explanation": "are 後面放形容詞 available。",
          "sentence": "The tickets are ___ online.",
          "zh": "票可以在網路上買到。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "availability": "availability（名詞）是「可得性；有空（的時間）」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-2b",
          "group": "grammar-4-2",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "careful",
            "carefully",
            "care",
            "careless"
          ],
          "answer": "carefully",
          "explanation": "形容動作 drive，用副詞 carefully。",
          "sentence": "Please drive ___.",
          "zh": "請小心開車。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "careful": "careful（形容詞）是「小心的」",
            "care": "care（名詞／動詞）是「照顧；在乎」",
            "careless": "careless（形容詞）是「粗心的」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-3b",
          "group": "grammar-4-3",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "improve",
            "improvement",
            "improvable",
            "improvingly"
          ],
          "answer": "improve",
          "explanation": "need to 後面接動詞原形。",
          "sentence": "We need to ___ our website.",
          "zh": "我們需要改善網站。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "improvement": "improvement（名詞）是「改善；進步」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-4b",
          "group": "grammar-4-4",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "product",
            "produce",
            "productive",
            "production"
          ],
          "answer": "productive",
          "explanation": "meeting 是名詞，前面用形容詞 productive。",
          "sentence": "It was a very ___ meeting.",
          "zh": "那是一場很有成效的會議。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "product": "product（名詞）是「產品」",
            "produce": "produce（動詞）是「生產」",
            "production": "production（名詞）是「生產」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-5b",
          "group": "grammar-4-5",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "construction",
            "construct",
            "constructive",
            "constructively"
          ],
          "answer": "construction",
          "explanation": "the 後面接名詞 construction。",
          "sentence": "The ___ of the bridge will start soon.",
          "zh": "橋的建造即將開始。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "construct": "construct（動詞）是「建造」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-6b",
          "group": "grammar-4-6",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "sharp",
            "sharply",
            "sharpen",
            "sharpness"
          ],
          "answer": "sharply",
          "explanation": "形容動詞 rose，用副詞 sharply。",
          "sentence": "Prices rose ___ this year.",
          "zh": "今年價格大幅上漲。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "sharp": "sharp（形容詞／副詞）是「鋒利的；（時間）整」"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-7b",
          "group": "grammar-4-7",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "options": [
            "complete",
            "completely",
            "completion",
            "completing"
          ],
          "answer": "complete",
          "explanation": "should 後面接動詞原形 complete。",
          "sentence": "You should ___ your report today.",
          "zh": "你今天應該完成報告。",
          "optionNotes": {
            "completely": "completely（副詞）是「完全地」",
            "completion": "completion（名詞）是「完成」"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "review",
      "title": "答案解析"
    },
    {
      "kind": "practice",
      "title": "延伸練習：多益實戰",
      "intro": "多益 Part 5 的出題方式，挑戰看看。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "grammar-4-x0",
          "group": "grammar-4-x0",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "多益實戰：選出最適合的答案",
          "options": [
            "excel",
