          ],
          "answer": "excellent",
          "explanation": "his ___ work：名詞 work 前面放形容詞 excellent。",
          "sentence": "Mr. Kim was praised for his ___ work on the project.",
          "zh": "金先生因為在專案上的出色工作而受到稱讚。",
          "optionNotes": {
